				<guid>http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scpdeclassified:scp-5005</guid>
				<title>解密：SCP-5005 - 长夜孤灯</title>
				<link>http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scpdeclassified:scp-5005</link>
